  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Benzyl isocyanide can be obtained by:</p><p>(A)<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6618203b-7201-4359-9d8a-f85dc8134421-9895856.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 120px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p>(B)<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/d80cfe45-6fec-45b5-8195-18fbef776b58-9895856_2.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 96px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p>(C)<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/77ef1def-b98e-44b4-99c5-b7989f5b2504-9895856_3.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 100px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p>(D)<br /><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/6a057571-a666-4260-ae44-34412a05ea9f-9895856_4.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 120px;\" />&nbsp;</p><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>",
    "image": null
  },
